card.statement:
[<<cite:MRS>>] The assignment

\begin{gather*}
S_{ij}^{(r)} \mapsto \sum\limits_{k,l=1}^N \sum\limits_{p=0}^r b_{kl} T_{ik}^{(p)} \overline{T}_{jl}^{(r-p)}
\end{gather*}

provides an embedding of $\mathfrak{U}_q(\mathcal{L}^{tw}(\mathfrak{g}_N))$ into $\mathfrak{U}_q(\mathcal{L}(\mathfrak{gl}_N))$.
